      "path": "APUCH/README.md",
      "title": "README",
      "format": "md",
      "primary": true,
      "excerpt": "APUCH Meaning: A Place U Called Home Chinese name: Brand Role APUCH means A Place U Called Home. Visual Direction Temperament: warm, safe, intimate, open, home like. Color cues: deep ink blue, knowledge gold, soft paper, institutional green. Imagery cues: threshold, home light, table, doorway, belonging, shelter, warm civic space. Agent Notes Use APUCH as the public IP name. Expand APUCH as A Place U Called Home . Ch",
      "text": "# APUCH\n\nMeaning: A Place U Called Home\n\nChinese name: \n\n## Brand Role\n\nAPUCH means A Place U Called Home.\n\n## Visual Direction\n\n- Temperament: warm, safe, intimate, open, home-like.\n- Color cues: deep ink blue, knowledge gold, soft paper, institutional green.\n- Imagery cues: threshold, home light, table, doorway, belonging, shelter, warm civic space.\n\n## Agent Notes\n\n- Use `APUCH` as the public IP name.\n- Expand `APUCH` as `A Place U Called Home`.\n- Chinese name is currently blank.\n",
      "html": "<h1 id=\"apuch-guide-1-apuch\">APUCH</h1>\n<p>Meaning: A Place U Called Home</p>\n<p>Chinese name: </p>\n<h2 id=\"apuch-guide-1-brand-role\">Brand Role</h2>\n<p>APUCH means A Place U Called Home.</p>\n<h2 id=\"apuch-guide-1-visual-direction\">Visual Direction</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Temperament: warm, safe, intimate, open, home-like.</li>\n<li>Color cues: deep ink blue, knowledge gold, soft paper, institutional green.</li>\n<li>Imagery cues: threshold, home light, table, doorway, belonging, shelter, warm civic space.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"apuch-guide-1-agent-notes\">Agent Notes</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Use <code>APUCH</code> as the public IP name.</li>\n<li>Expand <code>APUCH</code> as <code>A Place U Called Home</code>.</li>\n<li>Chinese name is currently blank.</li>\n</ul>\n"
    }
  ],
